      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bradley%2C_Maine"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Leonard's Mills hosts the Maine Forest and Logging Museum, founded in 1960, where live steam and water‑powered mills demonstrate historic timber production.",
